{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XNUd5oR3e5JWS9Xswbs6dM","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines review form\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2026%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Call for Papers\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Robot Learning Foundation\",\"url\":\"https://www.robot-learning.org/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2026 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"CVPR 2026 Reviewer Guidelines\",\"url\":\"https://cvpr.thecvf.com/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuidelinesq\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found regarding CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines and review form:\n\nThe search results show information about CoRL 2026's general submission and author guidelines, but do not appear to contain a dedicated page specifically for CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines or a review form. \n\nHowever, I did find some relevant information:\n\n1. **Review Process**: CoRL aims to have at least two reviewers per paper.\n\n2. **Reciprocal Review Requirement**: All submissions must include at least one author who agrees to serve as a CoRL reviewer.\n\nThe search results include reviewer guidelines from CoRL 2023, which provides guidance on review criteria such as relevance to robot learning, evaluation of limitations sections, and constructive feedback. However, I was unable to locate specific 2026 reviewer guidelines or review form documents in the search results.\n\nFor the most current CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines and review form, I recommend:\n- Checking the official CoRL 2026 website at corl.org\n- Visiting the OpenReview submission portal at https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2026/Conference\n- Contacting the CoRL 2026 organizers directly\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f5e0932-32f2-4b4b-9817-0d2ade2fda2a","uuid":"61c8792f-a696-4610-bc71-7f09edb3117d","timestamp":"2026-05-15T16:26:57.028Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines review form","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01FudZU43FV8gSwafKSSujhb","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors","url":"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors"},{"title":"CoRL 2026 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2026%2FConference"},{"title":"CoRL 2026 - Call for Papers","url":"https://www.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers"},{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"Robot Learning Foundation","url":"https://www.robot-learning.org/"},{"title":"CoRL 2026","url":"https://www.corl.org/"},{"title":"ICLR 2026 Reviewer Guide","url":"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuide"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference"},{"title":"CVPR 2026 Reviewer Guidelines","url":"https://cvpr.thecvf.com/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuidelinesq"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what I found regarding CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines and review form:\n\nThe search results show information about CoRL 2026's general submission and author guidelines, but do not appear to contain a dedicated page specifically for CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines or a review form. \n\nHowever, I did find some relevant information:\n\n1. **Review Process**: CoRL aims to have at least two reviewers per paper.\n\n2. **Reciprocal Review Requirement**: All submissions must include at least one author who agrees to serve as a CoRL reviewer.\n\nThe search results include reviewer guidelines from CoRL 2023, which provides guidance on review criteria such as relevance to robot learning, evaluation of limitations sections, and constructive feedback. However, I was unable to locate specific 2026 reviewer guidelines or review form documents in the search results.\n\nFor the most current CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines and review form, I recommend:\n- Checking the official CoRL 2026 website at corl.org\n- Visiting the OpenReview submission portal at https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2026/Conference\n- Contacting the CoRL 2026 organizers directly"],"durationSeconds":6.940984181}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Srypb47PKG2AcGYbJzCupm","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2025 2024 reviewer guidelines scoring rubric acceptance rate\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2025-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"CORL 2025 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2025-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2024-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"About Our Ratings & Reviews [2025]\",\"url\":\"https://educationdata.org/about-our-ratings-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"CORL 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2024-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate: Statistics of acceptance rate for the main robotics conference · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found regarding CoRL 2025 and 2024:\n\n## Reviewer Guidelines\n\nFor CoRL 2024, submissions were evaluated based on the significance and novelty of the results, either theoretical or empirical, with results judged on the degree to which they have been objectively established and/or their potential for scientific and technological impact, as well as their relevance to robotic learning.\n\n## Review Process\n\nArea Chairs (ACs) identify desk rejection candidates, and the Program Committee (PC) examines the candidates and makes the final decision.\n\n## Scoring Rubric\n\nUnfortunately, the search results don't contain detailed information about a specific scoring rubric for CoRL 2025 or 2024. The results reference how statistics are compiled from reviewer scores but don't provide the actual rubric used by reviewers.\n\n## Acceptance Rate\n\nThe search results point to paper lists and statistics pages on Paper Copilot and OpenReview for both CoRL 2025 and 2024, but the specific acceptance rate figures are not displayed in the search results themselves. The results explain how acceptance rates are calculated but don't provide the actual rates. You would need to visit the Paper Copilot statistics pages directly or the OpenReview conference page to see the specific acceptance rate data.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f5e0932-32f2-4b4b-9817-0d2ade2fda2a","uuid":"05f363dc-0983-48a6-9605-c416531db9dc","timestamp":"2026-05-15T16:26:57.497Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2025 2024 reviewer guidelines scoring rubric acceptance rate","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_015zaZdegTcfQhFpfgKwV9Kb","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2025 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2025-paper-list/"},{"title":"CORL 2025 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2025-statistics/"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2024-paper-list/"},{"title":"CoRL Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","u